function ClerkApp(){const {getToken}=useAuth();const {user,isLoaded}=useUser();const clerk=useClerk();const remove=useReverification(async(expectedSubject:string)=>{const token=await getToken({skipCache:true});const response=await fetch('/api/me',{method:'DELETE',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Auction-Subject':expectedSubject,Authorization:`Bearer ${token||''}`},body:JSON.stringify({confirmation:'DELETE MY ACCOUNT'})});const data=await response.json();if(!response.ok&&!data.clerk_error)throw new Error(data.message||'Account deletion could not be confirmed.');return data;});const deleteAccount=async()=>{if(!user)throw new Error('Sign in again before deleting your account.');const subject=user.id,sessionId=clerk.session?.id;const result=await remove(subject);if(!result?.accepted)throw new Error('Account deletion was not confirmed.');if(sessionId)await clerk.signOut({sessionId});};return <App getToken={getToken} identityLoaded={isLoaded} deleteClerkAccount={deleteAccount} clerkUser={user?{id:user.id,name:user.fullName||user.firstName||'Captain'}:undefined}/>}
createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(<AppErrorBoundary>{clerkKey?<ClerkProvider publishableKey={clerkKey} localization={auctionArenaLocalization}><ClerkApp/></ClerkProvider>:import.meta.env.PROD?<main id="main-content" className="workspace" tabIndex={-1} role="alert"><div className="panel"><span className="eyebrow">SIGN-IN CONFIGURATION</span><h1 className="page-title">Clerk is not configured for this build.</h1><p className="muted">This production build was created without <code>VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY</code>, so the real sign-in experience is unavailable. Local test identities are intentionally excluded from production builds. Rebuild with the Clerk publishable key set, then reload.</p></div></main>:<App/>}</AppErrorBoundary>);
